# Lambda checking mode with parameterized function type alias and concrete args.
# [Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a]]]] — (a → b) function type.
# [@[Mapper Integer String]] expands to [Fn@String [Integer]], checking the lambda
# against a concrete type (Int) → String.
[
  Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a]]]
  f: [@[Mapper Integer String] [fn [let _@Integer] "result"]]
  result: [f 123]
]
=== out
["Mapper": ["Fn": Mapper.Fn]  "f": [fn [let _] ...]  "result": "result"]
